    "text": "<div class=creature>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-title\"><span>{{!!title}}</span><span>2级 杂兵 游击</span></div>\n<div class=bg-title><span>中型 精界 类人生物</span><span>XP {{!!xp}}</span></div>\n<div><span>''HP'' 1；失手攻击无法伤害杂兵</span><span>''先攻'' +6</span></div>\n<div><span>''AC'' 16，''强韧'' 13，''反射'' 15，''意志'' 14</span><span>''侦查'' +7</span></div>\n<div><span>''速度'' 7</span><span>''感官'' 昏暗视觉</span></div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">特性</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">荒野步伐</div>\n<div class=description>该精灵快步时无视困难地形。</div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">标准动作</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">{{$:/dnd/images/meleebasic}}短剑（武器）✦随意</div>\n<div class=description>攻击：近战 1（一个生物）+7vs.AC<br>命中：5 点伤害，且该精灵快步最多 2 格。失手：该精灵可以快步 1 格。</div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span>''力量'' 14（+3）</span><span>''敏捷'' 17（+4）</span><span>''感知'' 12（+2）</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span>''体质'' 12（+2）</span><span>''智力'' 14（+3）</span><span>''魅力'' 14（+3）</span></div></div>\n<div><div class=\"ability\"><span>''阵营'' 无</span><span style=flex-basis:auto>''语言'' 通用语，精灵语</span></div></div>\n<div><div class=\"ability\"><span style=flex-basis:auto>''装备'' 革甲，短剑</span></div></div>\n</div>",
